==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
Seared Gourmet Steaks are a type of [[Roasted Food]], and they can be made by burning [[Raw Gourmet Meat]]s with [[Fire]] or a [[Scorching Climate]].<ref>{{Cite Guide|BotW Piggyback|page= 295}}</ref> They can also be purchased from [[Estan]]'s [[Stall]] in [[Gerudo Town]], and [[Black Hinox]]es may drop them when defeated. Since no seasonings have been added, the natural flavor of Seared Gourmet Steaks is able to shine.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> They can be eaten by [[Link]] to restore four and a half of his [[Heart]]s.

